          <span class="crumbs-current">ADHICS v2 Compliance</span>
        </nav>

        <div class="svc-hero">
          <div class="label" style="justify-content:center;"><div class="text-small color-grey">GRC — Healthcare Flagship</div></div>
          <h1 class="heading-large">ADHICS v2 Compliance — Abu Dhabi Healthcare</h1>
          <p class="text" style="max-width:720px;margin:1rem auto 0;">
            Controls-by-controls assessment and remediation against the <strong>Abu Dhabi Healthcare Information and Cyber Security Standard (ADHICS v2)</strong> — the mandatory Department of Health – Abu Dhabi framework for providers, payers, and health-IT entities. Get to a DoH assessment-ready, Malaffi-eligible posture. Led by a GRC Mastery + ISO 27001 Lead Auditor practitioner.
          </p>

          <div class="svc-hero-badges">
            <span class="svc-hero-badge svc-hero-badge-price">AED 16,000 – 42,000</span>
            <span class="svc-hero-badge svc-hero-badge-certs">GRC Mastery · ISO 27001 LA</span>
            <span class="svc-hero-badge svc-hero-badge-time">3 – 5 weeks</span>
          </div>

          <div class="svc-hero-ctas">
            <div class="button">
              <a href="/#contact?service=adhics" class="button-hidden w-button">Book a 30-min Scoping Call →</a>
              <div class="button-wrapper"><div class="button-text">Book a 30-min Scoping Call →</div></div>
              <div class="button-accent-gradinet"></div>
            </div>
            <a href="#faq" class="svc-hero-cta-secondary">Jump to FAQ</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section bg-color-dark">
      <div data-wf--noise--variant="absolute" class="noise-wrapper w-variant-4c0280f5-2522-b840-9cb4-de0542cf64ab"><div class="noise w-variant-4c0280f5-2522-b840-9cb4-de0542cf64ab"></div></div>
      <div class="container-medium">
        <h2 class="svc-sec-title">What it is</h2>
        <div class="svc-sec-body">
          <p>A focused, 3 – 5 week assessment of your healthcare organisation's posture against <strong>ADHICS v2</strong> — the Department of Health – Abu Dhabi standard covering information-security governance, human-resources and physical security, access control, operations and communications, health-information handling, third-party security, incident management, and continuity.</p>
          <p>We review your existing controls, interview stakeholders across clinical IT, operations, HR, and administration, observe the technical and procedural evidence across your in-scope systems (EMR, PACS, LIS, pharmacy, and medical-device networks), and map every applicable ADHICS control to its current implementation maturity. The output is a gap report, a prioritised remediation roadmap, and a mapping of existing ISO 27001 / NIST / CIS work to ADHICS — so remediation doesn't duplicate effort.</p>
          <p>Led by a practitioner holding <strong>GRC Mastery</strong> and <strong>ISO 27001 Lead Auditor</strong> credentials with hands-on experience in UAE regulated-sector environments.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div data-wf--noise--variant="absolute" class="noise-wrapper w-variant-4c0280f5-2522-b840-9cb4-de0542cf64ab"><div class="noise w-variant-4c0280f5-2522-b840-9cb4-de0542cf64ab"></div></div>
      <div class="container-medium">
        <h2 class="svc-sec-title">What this is <em>not</em></h2>
