          <div class="svc-not-item"><div class="svc-not-ico"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M3 3l6 6M9 3l-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div><strong>Not the DoH assessment itself.</strong> The Department of Health assesses formally; we get you compliant and assessment-ready before that happens.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-not-item"><div class="svc-not-ico"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M3 3l6 6M9 3l-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div><strong>Not a generic IT audit.</strong> ADHICS-specific — scoped to the standard's control domains and DoH evidence expectations, not a broad checklist.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-not-item"><div class="svc-not-ico"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M3 3l6 6M9 3l-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div><strong>Not checklist scoring.</strong> Evidence-based — we observe clinical and technical systems, interview, validate, and rate maturity.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-not-item"><div class="svc-not-ico"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M3 3l6 6M9 3l-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div><strong>Not duplicate work.</strong> Existing ISO 27001 / CIS / NIST controls are mapped — you don't re-build what already satisfies ADHICS.</div></div>
        </div>
