          <li class="svc-deliv-item"><svg class="svc-deliv-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><strong>Controls-by-controls assessment report</strong> — every applicable ADHICS control with current state, maturity rating (0 – 4), evidence observed, gap severity.</div></li>
          <li class="svc-deliv-item"><svg class="svc-deliv-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><strong>Cross-framework mapping</strong> — where your ISO 27001 / CIS / NIST evidence already satisfies ADHICS (to avoid duplicate work).</div></li>
          <li class="svc-deliv-item"><svg class="svc-deliv-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><strong>Prioritised remediation roadmap</strong> — 90-day / 6-month / 12-month plan with effort estimates, sequenced to DoH expectations.</div></li>
          <li class="svc-deliv-item"><svg class="svc-deliv-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><strong>Executive summary</strong> — 2-page board / medical-director brief with a maturity heat map.</div></li>
          <li class="svc-deliv-item"><svg class="svc-deliv-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><strong>DoH / Malaffi readiness statement</strong> — a document evidencing ADHICS posture for regulator submission or Malaffi integration.</div></li>
          <li class="svc-deliv-item"><svg class="svc-deliv-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><strong>Walkthrough session</strong> — 90-minute live review with your clinical-IT and executive teams.</div></li>
        </ul>
