          <div class="svc-process-row"><div class="svc-process-row-num">03</div><div><div class="svc-process-row-step">Controls assessment &amp; mapping</div><div class="svc-process-row-duration">3 – 5 days</div></div><div class="svc-process-row-desc">Maturity rating per control, cross-framework mapping, gap-severity scoring against ADHICS v2.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-process-row"><div class="svc-process-row-num">04</div><div><div class="svc-process-row-step">Reporting</div><div class="svc-process-row-duration">3 – 5 days</div></div><div class="svc-process-row-desc">Controls report, remediation roadmap, executive summary, DoH / Malaffi readiness statement.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-process-row"><div class="svc-process-row-num">05</div><div><div class="svc-process-row-step">Walkthrough</div><div class="svc-process-row-duration">90 minutes</div></div><div class="svc-process-row-desc">Live session covering gaps, roadmap priorities, and remediation sequencing.</div></div>
