    <section class="section">
      <div data-wf--noise--variant="absolute" class="noise-wrapper w-variant-4c0280f5-2522-b840-9cb4-de0542cf64ab"><div class="noise w-variant-4c0280f5-2522-b840-9cb4-de0542cf64ab"></div></div>
      <div class="container-medium">
        <div class="section-wrapper-vertical" style="align-items:center;text-align:center;">
          <h2 class="heading" style="max-width:600px;">Facing an ADHICS deadline — or a Malaffi integration that needs proof of compliance?</h2>
          <p class="text-medium" style="max-width:600px;">Book a 30-minute scoping call. We'll assess applicability, scope the engagement, and send a written quote within 48 hours.</p>
          <div class="button">
            <a href="/#contact?service=adhics" class="button-hidden w-button">Book a Scoping Call →</a>
            <div class="button-wrapper"><div class="button-text">Book a Scoping Call →</div></div>
            <div class="button-accent-gradinet"></div>
